    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
      "english": "At Sāvatthī. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
      "english": "Seated to one side, that mendicant said to the Buddha: "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "“ko nu kho, bhante, hetu, ko paccayo, yena midhekacco kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā sāragandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ …pe… ",
      "english": "“Sir, what is the cause, what is the reason why someone, when their body breaks up, after death, is reborn in the company of the gods who live in fragrant heartwood … "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "pheggugandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ … ",
      "english": "softwood … "
    },
    {
