      "english": "sprouts … "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "pattagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ … ",
      "english": "leaves … "
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "pupphagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ … ",
      "english": "flowers … "
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "phalagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ … ",
      "english": "fruit … "
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "rasagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ … ",
      "english": "sap … "
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "gandhagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ sahabyataṁ upapajjatī”ti? ",
      "english": "fragrant scents?” "
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "pali": "“Idha, bhikkhu, ekacco kāyena sucaritaṁ carati, vācāya sucaritaṁ carati, manasā sucaritaṁ carati. ",
      "english": "“Mendicant, it’s when someone does good things by way of body, speech, and mind. "
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "Tassa sutaṁ hoti: ",
      "english": "And they’ve heard: "
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "‘sāragandhe adhivatthā devā dīghāyukā vaṇṇavanto sukhabahulā’ti. ",
      "english": "‘The gods who live in fragrant heartwood … fragrant scents are long-lived, beautiful, and very happy.’ "
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "Tassa evaṁ hoti: ",
      "english": "They think: "
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "pali": "‘aho vatāhaṁ kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā sāragandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ …pe… ",
      "english": "‘If only, when my body breaks up, after death, I would be reborn in the company of the gods who live in fragrant heartwood … "
