    {
      "number": 37,
      "pali": "So kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā gandhagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ sahabyataṁ upapajjati. ",
      "english": "When their body breaks up, after death, they’re reborn in the company of the gods who live in fragrant scents. "
    },
    {
      "number": 38,
      "pali": "Ayaṁ kho, bhikkhu, hetu, ayaṁ paccayo, yena midhekacco kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā gandhagandhe adhivatthānaṁ devānaṁ sahabyataṁ upapajjatī”ti. ",
      "english": "This is the cause, this is the reason why someone, when their body breaks up, after death, is reborn in the company of the gods who live on fragrant scents.” "
